OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fa band of rain and stronger winds
OL,7,Fmoving eastwards during the evening.
OL,8,FThis will be followed by showers in
OL,9,Fthe early hours, becoming confined to
OL,10,Fthe coast by the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FMostly dry with showers and
OL,13,Flow cloud along the coast at first.
OL,14,FThis clearing up during the morning to
OL,15,Fleave a fine day with good spells of
OL,16,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
