OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,6,Fand strong winds spreading in late on
OL,7,FSaturday. Cloudy with isolated showers
OL,8,Fand lighter winds on Sunday and
OL,9,FMonday. Low cloud Monday afternoon.
OL,10,FTemperatures trending a little above
OL,11,Faverage.
